{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_18\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 18</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_18\">Problem 18</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 18\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>One of the factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7cacb4e8d99cc10f57872d69361e7a280097596.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/5/a552e32c26d862485a97ef022a3ced5f14d9ce17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x^2+2 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ x+1 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ x^2-2x+2 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ x^2-4\\\\  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/4/484ca0126c2a8f5f65a76b39e17d070a624a0b81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4 + 4 = x^4 - 4x^2 + 4 + 4x^2 = (x^2 + 2)^2 - (2x)^2 = (x^2 - 2x + 2)(x^2 + 2x + 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"615\" height=\"21\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/f/07fa0b68112fc8658b3c1631bdef3a803010b105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ x^2-2x+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"138\" height=\"32\" /> is correct.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recall the Sophie Germain Identity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/d/31d043c3f1431c4f130d975cdc0071f3dc0e5a5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^4 + 4b^4 = (a^2 - 2ab + 2b^2)(a^2 + 2ab + 2b^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"343\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/8/5f87fa49ae90cffa397f7a51b92e2c3f83c2aa93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4 + 4 = (x^2-2x+2)(x^2+2x+2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"285\" height=\"21\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/f/07fa0b68112fc8658b3c1631bdef3a803010b105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ x^2-2x+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"138\" height=\"32\" /> is correct.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Choice (A) is incorrect, as the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/7/9276fb2a2f285ccac158c332a4b861f396f3e17f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/e/18e8a8003defd572f5bef9d80ac92b8079513951.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pm i\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"21\" />, neither of which is a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/0/ee02b48e2760c0f590de713fcbc38edfddd6f79b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Choice (B) is incorrect, as the root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/b/43b6bcde0e66de78dde6250138abf955e45c4ed5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, which is not a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/0/ee02b48e2760c0f590de713fcbc38edfddd6f79b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Choice (D) is incorrect, as the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/7/3c7f6a17b3f435806b9740f0de2d1d1798674c3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/5/e6588c6e54b4cc2501b76a080de5b56efcd2bc56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pm 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />, neither of which is a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/0/ee02b48e2760c0f590de713fcbc38edfddd6f79b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nChoice (C) is correct, as the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/b/54b32c3e70b4ae40f3e448afa73d842cce8260df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 2x + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf480eb21b2f02911ce8c3b9903b17d858bbad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\pm i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" />, both of which are roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/0/ee02b48e2760c0f590de713fcbc38edfddd6f79b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a hr